      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INCREDIBLE ROGUE (4) shapes well for this on his handy win a few runs back, getting around Northam over 509m in 29.61 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Has the ability and expected to go close again. ROSIE BROWNE (1) collided in the run but proved too strong when a 1.3 lengths winner in fast time (21.76) in a Grade 5 at this track. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. FROGS MONELLI (8) filled a minor placing last start at Mandurah behind Zambora Bliss (27.47) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to give a sight. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can feature again. SPOTLESS WAYNE (5) is another with top-three prospects.",
